      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>29</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>37</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
