  "solution": {
    "text": "Any point on given line is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3,5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />This must satisfy the equation of the plane<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />So, the coordinates of point are&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />A normal vector to given plane <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />A vector parallel to given line <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />A vector parallel to required line<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Equation of required line is<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />&nbsp;"
